### ShopNest API — open in VS Code (REST Client extension) or IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Run them top to bottom; the login request stores the JWT in a variable.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Register a new customer
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ridha F",
  "email": "ridha@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

### 2. Login as the seeded customer
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@shopnest.com",
  "password": "User@123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Who am I
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Browse the catalogue (public)
GET {{host}}/products?page=0&size=8&sort=price_asc

### 5. Search + filter
GET {{host}}/products?search=headphones

### 6. Single product
GET {{host}}/products/1

### 7. Categories (public)
GET {{host}}/categories

### 8. Add to cart
POST {{host}}/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### 9. View cart
GET {{host}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Update a cart line (use the id returned above)
PUT {{host}}/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3 }

### 11. Checkout (mock payment)
POST {{host}}/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingName": "Ridha F",
  "shippingPhone": "9876543210",
  "shippingAddress": "12 MG Road, Flat 4B",
  "shippingCity": "Chennai",
  "shippingPincode": "600001",
  "paymentMethod": "CARD"
}

### 12. My orders
GET {{host}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------- ADMIN ----------------

### 13. Login as admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@shopnest.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 14. Create a product
POST {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bluetooth Speaker",
  "description": "Portable 20W speaker with 12h playtime.",
  "price": 2199.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608043152269-423dbba4e7e1?w=600&q=80",
  "stock": 30,
  "active": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 15. Update a product
PUT {{host}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Noise-Cancelling Headphones",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "price": 4599.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505740420928-5e560c06d30e?w=600&q=80",
  "stock": 35,
  "active": true,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 16. Admin catalogue (includes hidden products)
GET {{host}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. All orders
GET {{host}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. Move an order along
PUT {{host}}/admin/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }

### 19. Negative test — customer token on an admin route (expect 403)
GET {{host}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Negative test — no token on a protected route (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/cart

# ============================================================
#  Wishlist
# ============================================================

### 21. My wishlist
GET {{host}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 22. Save a product (idempotent - saving twice is not an error)
POST {{host}}/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1 }

### 23. Just the saved ids (drives the heart icons on the grid)
GET {{host}}/wishlist/ids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Move a saved product into the cart
POST {{host}}/wishlist/1/move-to-cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Unsave a product
DELETE {{host}}/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ============================================================
#  Ratings & reviews
# ============================================================

### 26. Reviews for a product (public - no token needed)
GET {{host}}/products/1/reviews

### 27. Post a review (posting again edits it rather than duplicating)
POST {{host}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "Exactly what I needed." }

### 28. Remove my own review
DELETE {{host}}/products/1/reviews/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 29. Negative test - rating outside 1..5 (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/products/1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 9 }

# ============================================================
#  Account
# ============================================================

### 30. My profile plus order/wishlist/review counts
GET {{host}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 31. Update name and phone
PUT {{host}}/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo Customer", "phone": "9876543210" }

### 32. Change password
PUT {{host}}/account/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "User@123", "newPassword": "User@1234" }

# ============================================================
#  Order detail & cancellation
# ============================================================

### 33. Cancel my own order (only before it ships; restores stock)
PUT {{host}}/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 34. Negative test - cancel an order that already shipped (expect 400)
PUT {{host}}/orders/2/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ============================================================
#  Admin dashboard
# ============================================================

### 35. Revenue, order counts by status, best sellers, low stock
GET {{host}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 36. Negative test - dashboard with a customer token (expect 403)
GET {{host}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
